{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://github.com/uutils/findutils",
    "description": [
      "使用从标准输入派生的参数运行命令。",
      "GNU xargs 的 Rust 实现。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--arg-file",
      "alias": [
        "-a"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-a, --arg-file <arg-file>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "从给定文件而不是标准输入读取参数。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--delimiter",
      "alias": [
        "-d"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-d, --delimiter <delimiter>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "使用给定分隔符切分输入。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--eof",
      "alias": [
        "-e"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-e, --eof [<eof-string>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "-E 的别名。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--exit",
      "alias": [
        "-x"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-x, --exit"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "构造出的命令行超过长度限制（见 -s）时终止，而不是减少参数个数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-args",
      "alias": [
        "-n"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-n, --max-args <max-args>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "设置每次命令调用最多从标准输入读取多少个参数（与 -L 和 -I/-i 互斥）。"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "10"
        },
        {
          "name": "100"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-chars",
      "alias": [
        "-s"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-s, --max-chars <max-chars>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "设置每次调用最多传入多少个字符。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-lines",
      "alias": [
        "-L"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-L, --max-lines <max-lines>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "设置每次命令调用最多从标准输入读取多少行（与 -n 和 -I/-i 互斥）。"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-procs",
      "alias": [
        "-P"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-P, --max-procs <max-procs>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "最多并行运行这么多个命令 [未实现]。"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "0"
        },
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--no-run-if-empty",
      "alias": [
        "-r"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-r, --no-run-if-empty"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "没有任何输入参数时完全不运行命令。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--null",
      "alias": [
        "-0"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-0, --null"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "按空字符而不是空白字符切分输入。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--replace",
      "alias": [
        "-i"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-i, --replace[=<R>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "指定 R 时等同于 -I R；否则等同于 -I {}。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--verbose",
      "alias": [
        "-t"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-t, --verbose"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "执行前把每条命令打印到标准错误。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-E",
      "usage": [
        "-E <eof-string>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "指定后，遇到与 eof-string 匹配的输入项时停止处理其余输入（指定 -d 或 -0 时忽略）。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "-I",
      "usage": [
        "-I <R>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "把初始参数中的 R 替换为从标准输入读取的名称；输入只按换行符切分（与 -L 和 -n 互斥）。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "-l",
      "usage": [
        "-l [<max-lines>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "等同于 -L，但未指定 max-lines 时默认值为 1。"
      ],
      "next": []
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "alias": [
        "-h"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-h, --help"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印帮助。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "alias": [
        "-V"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-V, --version"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印版本。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
